=== gambling_scene ===
Come all children! The stars have told me that luck is on your side today! #speaker:Uncle Dink #emotion:happy
Hey *player*! Come check this out! Crazy psycho homeless guy has made a gambling game! We are going to be rich! #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
I say we bet safe. That way we can play longer, giving us more favorable odds to win money and the losses are less significant. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
No no, what are we? Pansies? We bet big so that we win big! #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
I say we either win money, or leave with nothing! No in between! #emotion:happy
You can't be serious. If we do that then we- #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
No Lucas, he's got a point. The only way to truly reap the rewards if you put all your marbles on the table. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:neutral
When you claim victory when putting it all on the line, the taste of victory becomes as sweet as honey. #emotion:neutral
If that doesn't fire you up to make an impulse decision *player* then I don't know what will. #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
You guys do realize that you are going to lose all your money. #speaker:Nikki #emotion:neutral
Oh *player*, don't fall into the fallacy. We learned about this in school. #emotion:neutral
Nikki I honestly do not remember asking for your input. #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
Yeah you're being a real Debbie Downer. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:neutral
I can make major improvements to the Carpentry if I win big. #emotion:happy
Forget the carpentry, if we win big we could have our own island! #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
Our own private island, where we can do whatever we want! #emotion:happy
Then we can have a bakery on that island! #speaker:Bryan #emotion:happy
Strange and specific choice but I like the excitement! #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
Uh, I mean we can do whatever I actually don't care. #speaker:Bryan #emotion:happy
Guys we should use the money to help the settlement reach its full potential. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
You know Lucas, just when I think you can't be any more vanilla, you prove me wrong almost everyday. #speaker:Jet #emotion:happy
Cmon children! Fate is waiting! #speaker:Uncle Dink #emotion:neutral
-> END

